WEBVTT

00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:11.240
Francine, I've finally caught up with you.

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:14.660
Let's do this.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:17.120
-Stop, Kato. Stand back.
-Move.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:19.620
I'm the one who will protect you.

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:37.680
Am I destined to lose my way?

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:40.850
All I want is to have fun in my life

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:46.400
All I want is to be with those I love

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:52.530
Ready or not
Here I come

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:56.200
I don't care anymore

00:00:56.370 --> 00:00:59.000
I just don't know anymore

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:02.540
I wish everything would just disappear

00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:05.670
There are days when I think like that

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:08.590
But everything is precious to me

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:11.430
And so I fight on

00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:14.930
Today was a tough day

00:01:15.140 --> 00:01:18.020
I almost gave up hope

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:24.110
But the truth is I don't want
to lose anything anymore

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:27.730
I wish everything would just disappear

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:30.990
There are days when I think like that

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:33.740
But everything is precious to me

00:01:33.910 --> 00:01:36.780
And so I must fight

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:55.510
#34 Rearguard

00:01:56.510 --> 00:01:58.600
I'm the one who will protect you.

00:01:58.810 --> 00:02:01.270
Yeah right, I can protect myself.

00:02:01.480 --> 00:02:05.730
Your mission is to go to space
for the sake of mankind.

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:08.150
Huh? Is he...

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:12.900
She's already decided for herself
who she belongs to.

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:16.660
Are you the one that owns Éléonore?

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:19.160
What are you talking about?

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:24.420
You see, I've fallen for that girl there.

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:27.920
I really want her.

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:29.500
Never!

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:33.260
Éléonore, you stay there and wait.

00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:37.390
I swear on a pigeon's beak,
I'll be right with you. But first...

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:40.310
I'm going to kill him.

00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:44.940
-Hey...
-Didn't you hear me?

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:47.150
I am your opponent.

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:51.780
Well, okay then.

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:55.150
I see my dear Éléonore
needs a little discipline.

00:02:55.490 --> 00:03:00.240
You won't die, anyway.
So let's have a little fun.

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:05.920
It's...

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:08.460
-Oh...?
-Arlequin!

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:14.340
Mr. Arlequin, eh? Long time no see.

00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:19.930
I swear on a centipede's legs,
it's going to be fun disciplining you.

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:21.350
I've seen enough.

00:03:21.890 --> 00:03:23.640
You're fighting me!

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:25.140
Boom!

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:26.480
Kato!

00:03:32.820 --> 00:03:36.450
Give it up. See? You're all bloody now.

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:40.620
Call it quits, and let's be good friends.

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:42.370
I will never.

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:47.290
You're a blood-sucking automaton.
As if you could be friends with a human.

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:53.050
You think you're a human, huh?

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:57.550
Let me tell you something.
A human that doesn't die isn't human.

00:03:58.470 --> 00:04:00.760
You're just like an automaton.

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:04.680
I bet humans don't even accept you
as one of them.

00:04:09.900 --> 00:04:11.270
You might be right.

00:04:13.570 --> 00:04:16.360
But still...

00:04:17.990 --> 00:04:21.780
I can sacrifice myself
for those who are precious to me!

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:27.200
And that precious person
is going to be me.

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:28.620
Les Arts Martiaux!

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:30.580
Flèche Enflammée!

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:36.090
Blade of Saint George!

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:37.970
Not bad.

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:41.050
-Okay, my turn.
-Éléonore!

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:43.930
Take that!

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:52.350
It's easy. I just take the puppeteer out.

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:58.780
Now then. Time to take care of
my rival in love while Éléonore is down.

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:01.530
Say bye-bye.

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:06.660
Let's see you try.

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:08.250
Wait.

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:16.380
This is my fight, Kato.

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:19.050
I already told you.

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:23.510
That I would be the one to protect you.

00:05:23.890 --> 00:05:26.640
You fool, look at yourself.

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:29.890
You don't have to know.

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:35.610
About how much you gave to me.

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:41.530
Like an abandoned puppet.

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:45.570
Being picked up by human hands
for the first time.

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:49.790
Like a stray dog being taken in.

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:53.920
And petted on the head
for the first time.

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:59.090
Out of the way, dear Éléonore.
I'm going to kill that human.

00:05:59.300 --> 00:06:01.670
Move! Stand back, I'll handle him.

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:04.800
Kato.

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:09.310
Thank you for coming into my life.

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:13.640
-What?
-If you won't move, I'll put you to sleep.

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:16.230
Thank you for talking to me.

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:23.240
Oh dear, is that the best you've got?

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:26.120
Thank you for giving me memories.

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:28.450
Les Arts Martiaux!

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:31.410
Swirling Tiger!

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:36.330
I don't care if you hate me again.

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:39.380
So please.

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:44.170
Will you come into my life again someday?

00:06:49.310 --> 00:06:50.140
Éléonore!

00:06:51.100 --> 00:06:52.470
Éléonore...!

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:01.530
So this is it.

00:07:09.410 --> 00:07:12.370
Not bad, human. You must be Narumi Kato.

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:14.870
What if I am?

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:18.920
I am Brighella Cavicchio da Val Brembana.

00:07:19.630 --> 00:07:23.380
All my opponents this far were weak.
I expect more from you.

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:27.090
Éléonore, don't you die.

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:29.930
No, forget about her.

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:34.020
My mission is to defeat him
and go to space.

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:36.140
For mankind.

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:39.270
-Ready?
-Always am.

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:48.820
Grim Reaper!

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:50.410
Sangre y Fuego!

00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:56.870
Know your place. You've put up
a good fight, but you're no match for me.

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:02.340
I am Captain Graziano.

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:06.170
I come from a noble lineage
dating back to the crusades.

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:08.180
Master, he's coming!

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:09.680
Dammit.

00:08:12.680 --> 00:08:16.350
I still recall the final move campaign
of 1982.

00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:18.310
How I defeated 10,000 shiroganes...

00:08:18.690 --> 00:08:21.230
Don't listen to him, he's lying!

00:08:21.440 --> 00:08:23.770
There's no way he even existed back then.

00:08:24.070 --> 00:08:28.820
Quiet! I am tired of you.
Time for you to perish.

00:08:29.030 --> 00:08:30.910
By my ancestors' lethal move.

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:32.780
Fracasso!

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:36.950
What's wrong, Narumi?

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:42.500
There's no qi in your punches,
just ungainly brute strength.

00:08:43.340 --> 00:08:44.380
You dare take me lightly?

00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:51.680
He's stronger than any automata
I've fought.

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:55.560
Now, show me that explosive force
I've heard about.

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:58.560
Or be skewered by my spear hand!

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:07.820
No wonder you're lackluster.
You can't channel qi into machine limbs.

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:12.820
Not all of me is machinery.
And I'm not finished yet.

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:17.240
Too slow.

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:20.500
How unskilled.

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:24.920
This is how you do a horse punch.

00:09:28.840 --> 00:09:31.300
I like fighting with my bare hands.

00:09:32.010 --> 00:09:36.470
Because it shows who is stronger,
not who has better weapons.

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:38.640
It is the true test of strength.

00:09:39.060 --> 00:09:42.850
Now you will become proof of my strength.

00:09:44.610 --> 00:09:46.940
I can't lose.

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:53.280
What are you reading?

00:09:53.490 --> 00:09:55.820
Leave me alone. They're just letters.

00:09:56.410 --> 00:09:59.330
The kids gave them to me when we left.

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:05.670
Dear Narumi. Hurry up and go ask
how to fix Mommy and Daddy.

00:10:05.880 --> 00:10:06.880
Be careful.

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:12.800
I'm going to bake Mommy cookies
when she gets better.

00:10:13.720 --> 00:10:17.550
Her body is like stone now
because of ZONAPHA.

00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:19.890
I can't lose.

00:10:23.440 --> 00:10:28.190
I'm disappointed. You're nothing but
a wooden doll that can hardly stand up.

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:32.240
The children love you, don't they?

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:35.780
What would a puppet-human like you
understand?

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:37.530
Go away.

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:38.660
Okay...

00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:45.170
That's right.

00:10:46.460 --> 00:10:51.260
I've said so many mean things to her.

00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:53.630
It's over, Narumi.

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:56.050
I have no use for a weak man.

00:10:56.840 --> 00:11:00.560
I will send you to where
I've sent countless weak men.

00:11:02.060 --> 00:11:05.850
I have to apologize to her.

00:11:08.190 --> 00:11:11.480
The launch pad is in sight now.

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:14.320
But you will not reach it.

00:11:14.530 --> 00:11:16.610
You have disappointed me.

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:20.700
So I will kill you in the most
shameful way for a fighter.

00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:23.950
With a missile.

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:29.040
Missile?

00:11:32.590 --> 00:11:34.340
That's right, Minghai.

00:11:36.220 --> 00:11:39.180
That's the most basic strike
of our school.

00:11:39.390 --> 00:11:40.550
The splitting fist.

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:45.810
The extended arm acts
as the launch pad of a missile.

00:11:46.690 --> 00:11:51.980
Let every body part act together as one,
channel your qi and...

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:54.480
push...

00:11:56.030 --> 00:11:57.200
forward.

00:12:04.830 --> 00:12:05.620
Split!

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:17.880
What heavy impact...!

00:12:18.510 --> 00:12:24.180
Thanks for that missile. It reminded me
of something really important.

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:32.360
That martial arts aren't about
just arms and legs.

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:38.360
He's saying my missile gave him a hint
on how to make a comeback?

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:45.080
Why did I shoot that missile?

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:48.660
I've hated weapons all this time.

00:12:52.460 --> 00:12:55.250
It's because of that one shot.

00:12:57.550 --> 00:13:01.640
I felt a dark sensation run through me
when I shot him.

00:13:02.180 --> 00:13:06.890
The sensation of destroying an enemy
with just one shot. And I liked it.

00:13:08.560 --> 00:13:10.190
This cannot be!

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:16.530
If only I hadn't shot that one missile...

00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:18.900
Crush!

00:13:43.930 --> 00:13:45.640
Master, Master!

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:51.310
You're tough. I thought human children
were powerless things that cried.

00:13:51.520 --> 00:13:52.890
You're different.

00:13:53.690 --> 00:13:56.900
I, who am courageous,
do not feel pain or fear.

00:13:57.110 --> 00:14:00.530
But you, a weak being,
must feel it acutely.

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:06.780
Cry and beg at my feet,
and I may let you live.

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:12.080
Cry, you say?

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:19.500
I've already cried a lot.

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:23.840
A lot of times. Over a lot of things.

00:14:26.180 --> 00:14:28.640
I cried when I learned about the past.

00:14:29.140 --> 00:14:33.890
I cried with sorrow
over this world right now.

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:39.940
But I'm not going to cry anymore.

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:45.280
Because if I cry,
I won't be able to save anybody.

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:48.030
You still haven't given up?

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:50.830
Is that your only plan, to not cry?

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:56.170
This isn't the time for me to cry.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:14:59.920
It's time to smile.

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:02.710
Then die smiling!

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:08.220
Come back, you coward.

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:12.810
Narumi. Narumi!

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:16.980
To smile means to be strong, right?

00:15:18.440 --> 00:15:23.110
It gives kindness and courage
to others and to ourselves.

00:15:24.780 --> 00:15:27.200
I'm going to be strong.

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:30.280
Don't forget this, Masaru.

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:33.660
If something bad happens,
think from the heart.

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.920
About what it is you need to do.

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:42.210
I'm going to be like Narumi.

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:44.340
You won't get away!

00:15:44.550 --> 00:15:47.800
I'm going to save everyone.

00:15:48.680 --> 00:15:51.010
I'm going to be strong like Narumi!

00:15:52.560 --> 00:15:54.060
What are you going to do?

00:15:56.770 --> 00:15:57.600
Master!

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:12.200
You fool. You can't even fly on your own.

00:16:12.410 --> 00:16:14.700
I see, you plan to die.

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:19.540
Then let me tell you about how
I fought in France's Hundred Years' War.

00:16:19.710 --> 00:16:21.460
Shut up, Captain Whatever.

00:16:23.840 --> 00:16:26.210
-What...
-Who cares about the past?

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:30.430
I despise history.
I despise the sorrowful past.

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:33.260
It's the people of the past

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:36.810
that entangle the people of today,
keeping them unhappy.

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:41.310
You can't be controlled by the past
if you want to live in today.

00:16:41.860 --> 00:16:45.320
Where did you learn to do this?

00:16:45.940 --> 00:16:50.070
That's right, you've downloaded
your grandfather's martial arts skills.

00:16:50.410 --> 00:16:52.240
And you say you hate the past?

00:16:52.450 --> 00:16:56.540
You're using the past,
the power of tradition.

00:16:57.080 --> 00:16:59.080
Traditions aren't just the past.

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:02.710
Human's traditions are about the heart.

00:17:03.170 --> 00:17:07.340
It's the heart trying to turn
a sorrowful past into something better.

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:09.670
Tell it to the other corpses!

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:11.760
Sangre y Fuego!

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:15.260
Miura-ryu, severing pulse blade.

00:17:16.810 --> 00:17:18.390
Matsukaze!

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:21.850
My blade, Spaventa!

00:17:22.690 --> 00:17:25.690
Grandpa, lend me your strength.

00:17:28.780 --> 00:17:32.950
All right, Masaru. Here's the next move.

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:35.410
How dare you!

00:17:35.620 --> 00:17:39.160
I am Captain Graziano,
descendant of the King of Aragon...

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:43.420
Miura-ryu, thousand-wind finishing blade.

00:17:44.210 --> 00:17:45.880
Korobi!

00:17:49.010 --> 00:17:50.050
Captain.

00:17:50.970 --> 00:17:54.640
Your traditions won't linger
for a second in my mind.

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:05.150
How's the fit of your pressure suit?

00:18:05.360 --> 00:18:07.820
Good. How's the rocket?

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:10.440
It'll be ready in 30 minutes.

00:18:10.990 --> 00:18:13.740
The weather is clear.
You'll be able to take off.

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:15.620
How are the kids?

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:18.620
They're in a safe place with Mingxia.

00:18:18.830 --> 00:18:20.580
We're here, Minghai.

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:24.620
-Narumi!
-I asked for us to be let in.

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:29.130
You really made it here.
Just like you promised.

00:18:29.340 --> 00:18:31.340
Good luck, Mr. Narumi.

00:18:34.180 --> 00:18:34.970
Oh no...

00:18:35.720 --> 00:18:37.640
Automata? Now?

00:18:41.270 --> 00:18:45.020
Go! Destroy the space shuttle!

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:53.530
How many are there?
Is there any way to stop them?

00:18:58.870 --> 00:19:00.040
Look at the monitor.

00:19:04.540 --> 00:19:06.170
-Huh?
-Minghai!

00:19:10.840 --> 00:19:14.760
What can a single human do, huh?
Kill him!

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:26.350
Stay back, Narumi! Remember your mission,
you have to stop ZONAPHA.

00:19:26.980 --> 00:19:29.650
I won't let you lay a finger on
the shuttle.

00:19:30.110 --> 00:19:34.990
My friends carried it here
at the cost of their lives.

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:38.870
Come on, fight me!

00:19:42.080 --> 00:19:47.460
I've never fought so many
at once before...

00:19:48.420 --> 00:19:50.590
But dammit...

00:19:51.090 --> 00:19:53.300
I won't lose!

00:19:57.340 --> 00:20:01.760
Huh?
The enemy is only coming from the front.

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:05.390
What's going on?

00:20:06.310 --> 00:20:09.730
Nobody's attacking me from behind.

00:20:13.900 --> 00:20:16.030
Somebody's got my back.

00:20:17.490 --> 00:20:20.280
Dang it, my hands are too full to check.

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:25.790
But there's somebody there. Who is it?

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:31.670
Who's protecting me?

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:40.800
I've finally met you again.

00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:47.060
Narumi. Narumi. Narumi!

00:20:47.770 --> 00:20:50.230
It's my turn now!

00:20:51.940 --> 00:20:54.440
You worthless puppets,
they're just humans!

00:20:54.650 --> 00:20:55.650
Watch out!

00:21:04.280 --> 00:21:06.290
I can faintly see a marionette moving.

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:08.290
A puppeteer?

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:10.080
I can't tell.

00:21:10.960 --> 00:21:13.040
But the guy behind me...

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:16.050
I'm glad he's here.

00:21:17.800 --> 00:21:18.670
Masaru!

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:21.050
Wow, who is he?

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:29.060
A former client of mine. He was a crybaby.

00:21:44.740 --> 00:21:47.700
We got them all.

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:53.670
Hey, thanks for...

00:21:58.590 --> 00:22:00.670
My eyes, what's that for?

00:22:01.010 --> 00:22:03.340
Master, why...?

00:22:20.740 --> 00:22:25.200
A past that can't become a memory
plays on repeat

00:22:25.410 --> 00:22:30.120
In my mind is a forgotten thing
that I still remember

00:22:30.290 --> 00:22:34.790
Questions remain unanswered
but I must go now

00:22:34.960 --> 00:22:39.670
I walk in the dark,
making a promise to my footprints

00:22:39.840 --> 00:22:44.340
So many similar beings
leading similar lives

00:22:44.510 --> 00:22:49.060
Was there a reason
for me to be born at all?

00:22:49.220 --> 00:22:53.810
The world lost all sound
but for the ticking of a clock

00:22:53.980 --> 00:22:58.650
A missing heart keeps shouting

00:22:58.820 --> 00:23:03.440
A meaningless life was shaking

00:23:03.610 --> 00:23:08.160
All because of your unique existence

00:23:08.370 --> 00:23:12.790
If the reason for the pain
is revealed someday

00:23:13.160 --> 00:23:17.540
If you find a home
for those tears someday

00:23:17.960 --> 00:23:22.630
You shall sleep
with the whole universe in your arms

00:23:22.800 --> 00:23:30.510
I know it still plays in your heart

00:23:30.850 --> 00:23:34.520
The melody that brought you here
